export const instructions = "Use session {action:create|resume} once, then retain basis.sessionId and basis.viewId. Every reply is a version-2 DecisionFrame with basis, control.gate, outcome, perceived scene and fresh events. Ordinary replies already contain the next decision view. observe resynchronizes and verifies retained uncertain input without replay; observe {operationId} returns historical evidence under result only. use {itemId} and interact {target} WITHOUT action are free discovery, even when only one offer exists. They never execute, consume turns or randomness, or start engine questions. Returned offers provide exact executable tool arguments bound to the observed viewId. Supply action explicitly to attempt one; eligibility is not safety or guaranteed success. use without itemId lists perceived item offers and explicit general-use attempts; cast starts a genuine spell decision, never invents spell references. interact defaults to here/self for discovery; spatial targets are direction, position, ref, or symbol with scope. Symbols must match uniquely or return candidates without input. Item references are opaque; never infer identity from labels. travel mode step is one ordinary adjacent attempt including tame-ally swaps, refusing displayed non-allies. Modes to, explore and descend are bounded navigation legs over known walking routes; run and climb retain native semantics, with runMode selecting native run behavior. Planning defaults to 1000 ms; zero permits no planning or input. Mutating variants require the observed viewId except session create/resume/suspend and exact respond decisionId calls. A stale view rejects without retargeting. respond action answer uses the exact decision.reply.valueSchema; cancel only when offered. Never answer implicitly, repeat an uncertain action, or treat historical receipts as live questions. Queries preserve input authority and human focus. Scene snapshots are the default; includeWorld and sinceViewId only change encoding. Recovery and ownership loss block input. Terminal facts live in scene.end. session action quit asks to end a run; suspend only releases it. help lists these families or their strict variant schemas.";
